{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Golemworks\u00a0</strong></i>is an experimental fusion of tower defense and factory builder. You must assemble a factory that generates an army of metal automatons. These automatons automatically fight and defend the mysterious golem foundry from waves of encroaching shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/f1e88020285d7b6b53e21fdd931e0099.poster.avif?t=1768670528\" width=708 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/f1e88020285d7b6b53e21fdd931e0099.webm?t=1768670528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/f1e88020285d7b6b53e21fdd931e0099.mp4?t=1768670528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Molds</strong> activate on a cooldown, and generate a golem core - the 'recipe' for an automaton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/edd53dd2adf5d28bdadc614d27d17887.poster.avif?t=1768670528\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/edd53dd2adf5d28bdadc614d27d17887.webm?t=1768670528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/edd53dd2adf5d28bdadc614d27d17887.mp4?t=1768670528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catalysts</strong>\u00a0are the production infrastructure. They can add levels, add elemental attributes, or otherwise alter a core </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/90b0851daf09921c2eb46c90d92c6528.poster.avif?t=1768670528\" width=592 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/90b0851daf09921c2eb46c90d92c6528.webm?t=1768670528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/90b0851daf09921c2eb46c90d92c6528.mp4?t=1768670528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival will hinge on your ability to optimize the strength of your golem army. Survival though may it be, it's nothing more than an emotionless struggle by what was left behind...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable catalysts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and varying difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All in-game art drawn by hand in Aseprite. Capsule art by @afique_asyraf</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918970?t=1768670528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/8776162da13f28d1980deb9bb31faa4901a885f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768670528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/6a0502dd2d32e6377d8f814a744dc5e0f7e42bd5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768670528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/6a0502dd2d32e6377d8f814a744dc5e0f7e42bd5/capsule_184x69.jpg